      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Manajemen Data: Add & Edit",
      "id": "add-edit",
      "intro": "Melalui Add & Edit Dialog (berupa drawer panel di sisi kanan layar berukuran 520px), Anda dapat mendaftarkan Response Code baru atau mengubah data yang sudah ada. Form ini terdiri dari 2 field utama: Code (TextInput) dan Description (Textarea).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Form Create / Edit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tambah Baru (Add Code)**: Klik tombol **Add Code** di toolbar kanan atas. Drawer *Create Response Code* akan muncul dari sisi kanan.\n• **Ubah Data (Edit)**: Klik salah satu Response Code untuk membuka Detail Panel di sisi kanan, lalu klik tombol **Edit Code**.\n• Drawer menampilkan judul **Create Response Code** atau **Edit Response Code**, badge *Add* atau *Edit*, dan subtitle *Set response code and description*.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:290px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#e0e7ff);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Response Code</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Set response code and description</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:10px;background:#e0e7ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;\">● Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">Response Code Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Code <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;background:#fff;\">Enter response code</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;background:#fff;height:36px;\">Enter description</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#cbd5e1;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:not-allowed;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Mengisi Field Form & Validasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nIsi field wajib berikut:\n1. **Code** *(Wajib)*: Kode respons baru (misalnya `05` atau `51`). TextInput.\n2. **Description** *(Wajib)*: Penjelasan penjelasan dari response code (textarea autosize, minimal 3 baris, maksimal 6 baris), misalnya `DO NOT HONOR` atau `INSUFFICIENT BALANCE`.\n\n> Tombol **Create** atau **Update** hanya akan aktif setelah kedua field terisi dengan benar (formik validation passed). Ketika disimpan, sistem akan mengirim data ke API backend dan me-refresh daftar response code.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:290px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#e0e7ff);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Response Code</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Set response code and description</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:10px;background:#e0e7ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;\">● Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">Response Code Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Code <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border:1.5px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">05</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border:1.5px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;height:36px;\">DO NOT HONOR</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(79,70,229,.35);\">Create</button></div></div>"
